1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,952
Listening. Practice test number four. You will hear five tasks. You will hear each recording twice. Get a paper and a pen ready.

2
00:00:11,167 --> 00:00:22,387
Task one. You will hear five short dialogues. For each dialogue choose one correct answer A, B, C or D.

3
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,024
Number 1.

4
00:00:35,233 --> 00:00:50,708
[Woman]: Dr Malá’s surgery. Unfortunately everything is full today. [Man]: And tomorrow morning? [Woman]: In the morning we have vaccinations. You can come tomorrow afternoon at two. [Man]: OK, I’ll come tomorrow afternoon. I couldn’t on Friday.

5
00:01:23,767 --> 00:01:24,700
Number 2.

6
00:01:34,900 --> 00:01:50,839
[Man]: On Saturday we’ll clean the flat and on Sunday we can go to the cinema. [Woman]: Not on Sunday. It’s grandma’s birthday, we’re going to see her. [Man]: Oh, right. Will you cook something? [Woman]: No, grandma cooks herself. We’ll just buy a cake.

7
00:02:24,367 --> 00:02:25,367
Number 3.

8
00:02:35,567 --> 00:02:46,304
[Woman]: How old is your son? [Man]: He’ll be ten, but not until December. Now he’s nine. [Woman]: And your daughter? [Man]: My daughter is younger, she’s six.

9
00:03:14,633 --> 00:03:15,700
Number 4.

10
00:03:25,900 --> 00:03:40,260
[Woman]: Igor, are you still working at that restaurant? [Man]: No, I left the restaurant. Now I work in a warehouse, loading goods. [Woman]: Do you like it there? [Man]: Yes, I have a better salary and weekends off.

11
00:04:12,233 --> 00:04:13,367
Number 5.

12
00:04:23,567 --> 00:04:35,341
[Man]: We’ve bought a new car! [Woman]: Congratulations! What kind? Red again? [Man]: No, we wanted white or blue, but in the end we bought a grey one. It was cheaper.

13
00:05:04,700 --> 00:05:16,011
Task two. You will hear five short announcements. For each one choose one correct answer A, B, C or D.

14
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:18,389
Number 6.

15
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:46,811
[Woman]: Dear customers, a little boy, Tomáš, five years old, is looking for his mum. He got lost in the toy department. He is now waiting at the information desk on the ground floor, next to checkout number three. Mum, please come to the information desk.

16
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,733
Number 7.

17
00:06:33,933 --> 00:06:45,736
[Man]: Good news for swimmers! The new city pool opens this Saturday. It was originally due to open on Monday, but construction finished earlier. On Sunday entry is free for children.

18
00:07:15,133 --> 00:07:16,362
Number 8.

19
00:07:26,567 --> 00:07:39,437
[Woman]: Dear passengers, the express train to Liberec is delayed by about forty minutes. The reason is heavy snow on the line. We apologise. The train to Kolín will depart on schedule.

20
00:08:09,900 --> 00:08:11,058
Number 9.

21
00:08:21,267 --> 00:08:33,998
[Man]: This month only at Mobil Plus! With every new phone you get free headphones. Cases and chargers are twenty percent off. Come in, we are open every day.

22
00:09:04,333 --> 00:09:05,490
Number 10.

23
00:09:15,700 --> 00:09:34,469
[Woman]: You have reached the town office. Office hours are Monday and Wednesday from eight to five p.m. On Tuesday and Thursday we are open only in the morning, from eight to twelve. On Friday the office is closed.

24
00:10:10,833 --> 00:10:20,541
Task three. You will hear five short texts. For each text choose the correct option A to G. Two options are extra.

25
00:10:21,733 --> 00:10:22,967
Number 11.

26
00:10:30,167 --> 00:10:38,997
[Man]: I’m Karel. I wanted to go cycling at the weekend, but I can’t. We bought paint and we’re going to paint the flat, the living room and the kitchen.

27
00:11:05,433 --> 00:11:06,662
Number 12.

28
00:11:13,867 --> 00:11:22,511
[Woman]: I’m Lin. Normally I have the weekend off, but this weekend I have to work because my colleague is ill.

29
00:11:48,733 --> 00:11:50,133
Number 13.

30
00:11:57,333 --> 00:12:05,467
[Man]: I’m Oleksandr. In winter I go to the mountains every weekend. On Saturday morning I’m going skiing in the Krkonoše mountains with friends.

31
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:32,517
Number 14.

32
00:12:39,733 --> 00:12:47,774
[Woman]: I’m Sofia. I already cleaned the flat on Friday. At the weekend I’m going to Brno, where my sister and parents live.

33
00:13:13,400 --> 00:13:14,700
Number 15.

34
00:13:21,900 --> 00:13:29,477
[Man]: I’m Juan. My wife got tickets to the National Theatre for her birthday. On Saturday evening we’re going to the opera there.

35
00:13:54,633 --> 00:14:04,385
Task four. You will hear five short dialogues. For each dialogue choose the correct picture A to F. One picture is extra.

36
00:14:05,600 --> 00:14:07,084
Number 16.

37
00:14:17,300 --> 00:14:26,441
[Man]: Excuse me, I’m low on petrol. Is there a petrol station nearby? [Woman]: Yes, about two kilometres straight on, at the roundabout.

38
00:14:53,167 --> 00:14:54,386
Number 17.

39
00:15:04,600 --> 00:15:13,602
[Woman]: Our dog is ill, it won’t eat. Do you know where there’s a vet here? [Man]: The veterinary clinic is on Lipová Street, number five.

40
00:15:40,200 --> 00:15:41,567
Number 18.

41
00:15:51,767 --> 00:16:01,465
[Woman]: The children are bored. Is there somewhere they can play? [Man]: Yes, the playground is in the park behind the church, there are swings and a sandpit.

42
00:16:28,767 --> 00:16:30,067
Number 19.

43
00:16:40,267 --> 00:16:47,411
[Man]: Where can I leave the car here? It’s no parking everywhere. [Woman]: There’s a big car park behind the shopping centre.

44
00:17:12,133 --> 00:17:13,261
Number 20.

45
00:17:23,467 --> 00:17:33,351
[Woman]: It’s so hot! I’d like something cold, maybe chocolate. [Man]: There’s an Italian ice-cream parlour on the square, theirs is excellent.

46
00:18:00,867 --> 00:18:05,507
Task five. You will hear a voice message. Fill in five pieces of information.

47
00:18:16,700 --> 00:18:49,819
[Woman]: Hello, Mrs Bondarenková, this is Jana Malá, your son’s class teacher. I want to tell you about the school trip. We are going to the National Museum in Prague. The trip will be on Thursday the fifteenth of October. We meet at seven thirty in front of the school. The trip costs three hundred crowns, please give the money to your son by Monday. Your son must bring a snack and a raincoat. If you have any questions, call me on 777 901 632. Thank you, goodbye.

48
00:18:50,333 --> 00:18:51,819
Once more.

49
00:20:08,667 --> 00:20:24,276
This is the end of the test. Count your points. You get one point for each correct answer. You can try the whole exam for free on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe to the channel.
